    "actions": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "action",
          "executed"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "action": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "commit",
              "push",
              "open_change_request",
              "mark_ready",
              "resolve_review_thread",
              "merge",
              "close_issue",
              "deploy_canonical_dev",
              "deploy_production",
              "apply_migration",
              "mutate_database",
              "destructive_database_action",
              "restart_service",
              "invoke_external_provider",
              "publish_review",
              "modify_proxy_or_dns",
              "rotate_secret",
              "delete_branch",
              "start_next_phase"
            ]
          },
          "executed": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "grant_id": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "target": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "result": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "allOf": [
          {
            "if": {
              "properties": {
                "executed": {
                  "const": true
                }
              }
            },
            "then": {
              "required": [
                "grant_id",
                "target"
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      }
    },
    "limitations": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "worktree": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "status"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "status": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "clean",
            "dirty_preexisting",
            "dirty_created_by_task",
            "unknown"
          ]
        },
        "details": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "next_action": {
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "allOf": [
    {
      "$comment": "A Codex review found that identity only required `repository`: a bundle omitting head_sha/tested_sha still validated even though readiness explicitly depends on same-HEAD evidence, so such a bundle could not establish its gates apply to the current HEAD. Require both once any gate_run is for a real, non-documentary surface (documentation-only bundles have no HEAD-bound gate to justify the requirement). A later Codex review of PR #159 found head_sha/tested_sha remained unconstrained plain strings even once required, so an empty string or a placeholder like \"unknown\" still satisfied the requirement; both properties now also carry a full 40-hex-character SHA pattern. A further Codex review of the same PR found the trigger trusted `environment.role` alone: a gate_run with `subject.type: \"source\"` (a real code gate) but `environment.role: \"documentation\"` still evaded the requirement, since `environment.role` alone is not proof the underlying subject was documentation. Trigger on any gate_run where `environment.role` and `subject.type` are not BOTH \"documentation\", so either field independently attesting to real content forces the requirement.",
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "gate_runs": {
            "contains": {
              "not": {
                "allOf": [
                  {
                    "properties": {
                      "environment": {
                        "properties": {
                          "role": {
                            "const": "documentation"
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "properties": {
                      "subject": {
                        "properties": {
                          "type": {
                            "const": "documentation"
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "identity": {
            "required": [
              "repository",
              "head_sha",
              "tested_sha"
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "x-generated-from": "policy/caem-policy.json",
  "x-caem-version": "2.1.0"
}
